---
import NerdBox from "@/components/caira/NerdBox.astro";
---

<div class="reveal">
  <div class="fig">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 460 160"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Queue diagram: a webhook replies instantly and hands the message to a queue with four pulsing dots, a worker then drains the queue and does the slow work safely"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="q-ar"
          markerWidth="9"
          markerHeight="9"
          refX="7"
          refY="4"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" style="fill:var(--cx-teal)"></path>
        </marker>
        <style is:inline>
          .qbx {
            fill: var(--cx-ink3);
            stroke: var(--cx-line2);
            stroke-width: 1;
          }
          .qq {
            fill: var(--cx-ink3);
            stroke: var(--cx-teal);
            stroke-width: 1.6;
          }
          .qt {
            font-family: var(--cx-mono);
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            fill: var(--cx-text);
          }
          .qs {
            font-family: var(--cx-mono);
            font-size: 9px;
            fill: var(--cx-muted);
          }
          .ql {
            stroke: var(--cx-faint);
            stroke-width: 1.6;
            fill: none;
            marker-end: url(#q-ar);
          }
          .qdot {
            fill: var(--cx-teal);
          }
        </style>
      </defs>

      <rect class="qbx" x="10" y="55" width="95" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="qt" x="57" y="77" text-anchor="middle">webhook</text>
      <text class="qs" x="57" y="92" text-anchor="middle">"got it" in 50ms</text
      >

      <line class="ql flow-dash" x1="105" y1="80" x2="160" y2="80"></line>

      <rect class="qq" x="165" y="50" width="130" height="60" rx="10"></rect>
      <text
        class="qt"
        x="230"
        y="72"
        text-anchor="middle"
        style="fill:var(--cx-teal)">QUEUE 📬</text
      >
      <circle class="qdot pulse" cx="195" cy="92" r="6"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="218"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.3s"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="241"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.6s"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="264"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.9s"></circle>

      <line class="ql flow-dash" x1="295" y1="80" x2="350" y2="80"></line>

      <rect class="qbx" x="355" y="55" width="95" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="qt" x="402" y="77" text-anchor="middle">worker</text>
      <text class="qs" x="402" y="92" text-anchor="middle">retried safely</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="play">
    <div class="play-label">▶ Playground: the model has a 25 second day</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <button class="btn" data-queue-mode="phone">📞 Phone-call mode</button>
      <button class="btn primary" data-queue-mode="queue"
        >📬 Letterbox mode</button
      >
    </div>
    <div class="playlog" id="queue-log">…</div>
  </div>
  <NerdBox>
    fallback is a decorator on the LlmProvider port (429/timeout → keyword
    matcher); jobs are Postgres rows drained by cron with SKIP LOCKED, claim
    100, dead-letter after 5 attempts; message-id idempotency makes Meta retries
    harmless
  </NerdBox>
</div>
